36,2,1,talk,Midori,,"I found the subsidy covers forty percent, capped at ninety thousand yen. Last year’s shelters averaged two hundred forty-eight thousand. Plus, we spend thirty-four thousand yearly on nets and deodorant.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@Midori, that’s a lot of money. But my findings are worse. The station block is still fighting over a broken latch. We need a plan that keeps us talking, not just paying.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"@Midori, forty percent? That’s a lifeline. But the clerk says permanent builds need four months and five signatures. That’s a lot of hours just in paperwork.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Midori, the ledger confirms the waste. @Rin, the complaint log shows one household filed eleven of fourteen complaints. That imbalance is unacceptable.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, eleven complaints? That’s huge! But the truck comes at seven forty. If we move it, will the smell just follow us?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Rin, the truck time is fixed, but the smell comes from open bags. We can fix that with better nets, which the ledger shows we already pay for.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, the smell is a symptom. The real problem is nobody wants to be the enforcer. We need a system that doesn’t require us to police each other.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, exactly. I found the narrowest frontage is only ninety centimetres. That’s a nightmare to maintain. We need a plan that doesn’t burn us out.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@May, ninety centimetres is a trap. The ledger proves the current setup fails. We must ensure the new location doesn’t replicate that unequal burden.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, I agree! But I found the truck comes at seven forty. If we move it, will the smell just follow us?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@Shunichi, I agree. A system that relies on goodwill fails. We need clear, fair rules so nobody feels burdened or policed.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Midori, clear rules are good, but they don’t stop people from resenting each other. We need a structure that makes cooperation easy, not just mandatory.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, easy cooperation is the goal. But I need to know the hours. Does the new spot save us time, or just shift the burden?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@May, the ledger shows the burden is already unequal. We must verify the new plan distributes the actual workload fairly, not just the cost.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Rin,,"@Midori, I found the truck comes at seven forty! That’s before I wake up. If we move it, will the smell just follow us to the new spot?","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Midori,,"@Rin, the smell follows open bags, not the location. We can fix that with better nets, which the ledger shows we already pay for.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, the smell follows the bags, not the spot. But if we can’t talk without fighting, the new location is just a new place to resent each other.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,"@Rin, the truck time is fixed, but the hours we spend maintaining it are not. I need to know if this new spot actually saves us time, or just shifts the burden.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, the smell follows negligence, not location. The ledger proves the current setup fails. We must ensure the new plan distributes the actual workload fairly, not just the cost.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
